  "notes": "Measured on N735AT's left side at Haneda, 2026-05-30 (from the terminal roof, nearly side-on), checked on two more that day and on the right side at Miami, 2026-02-20. The cheatline is about 0.25 m deep, its steps straight (corners), the long run following the windows' foot to the tail cone. The base reads as a light silver-gray paint in every photo (not polished metal). The fin's red band is about 0.7 m wide, so it takes most of the tip's short chord. The Flagship script's underline, 'THE', 'FLAGSHIP DFW' under the cockpit, the registration and small flag on the fin aren't drawn; the script is set in a stand-in, not drawn as a mark."
